    "description": "Restaurant Technologies provides automated cooking oil management, hood and flue cleaning, and related back-of-house services to restaurants and other foodservice operators. Its customer base includes quick-service and full-service restaurant chains, independent restaurants, grocery delis, hotels, casinos, universities, and hospitals. The company operates a route-based, service-heavy model supported by installed equipment and a depot network rather than a purely asset-light software or marketplace model. Public disclosures state that it serves more than 45,000 customer locations through 41 depots with more than 1,200 employees across the United States. ECP agreed to acquire the company in February 2022 and identifies April 2022 as its investment date; Restaurant Technologies now operates as an essential outsourced kitchen services platform under that ownership.",
